WEBVTT

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:45.020
I'm home.

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:46.710
Welcome back!

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.640
What's wrong
with the manager?

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.450
I haven't seen her for
the last couple of days.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.890
This is rent.

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:37.470
This is my food bill.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:46.060
But if l eat
nothing but noodles...

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:52.500
And if this goes for
miscellaneous charges...

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.270
With what's left...

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:08.430
Thank you. Come again.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:11.600
Why?

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:13.810
Chachamaru's Christmas party.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.750
Who can
afford a party?

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:19.510
You're not coming?

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.820
Coach Mitaka is a
confirmed guest.

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:24.870
And that means--

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:28.840
That naturally the
manager will be there, too.

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:31.520
And that means--

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.850
A toast, to the
beauty in your eyes.

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:47.570
Kyoko...

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:54.940
Kyoko...

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:01.600
A-A-A-And that means--

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:06.260
And that means
you're gonna be there, too.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:08.910
Starts at five sharp.

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:19.040
I've got 2488 left.

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:21.320
And with that...

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:24.780
...if there aren't
any other emergencies...

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:29.330
No! I have to give
a present on Christmas!

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:33.380
Even if it's cheap! If it's
sincere, she'll understand!

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.980
Right!
I'll go shopping!

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:40.160
Now if I only knew what's
up with the manager...

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:44.020
Godai?
Telephone!

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:45.630
O-Okay!

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:47.690
Thanks--

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:00.340
Keep it down!

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:01.960
S-Sorry.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:06.160
Damn. At least
give me a glimpse.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:08.850
Kozue?

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:14.770
Today? Sure. I'll meet you
after I've done some shopping.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:23.760
Okay. Bye.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:29.220
Mrs. Ichinose, please
don't eavesdrop on my calls.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:34.070
It's just a call from your girl.
No reason to race down here.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:36.950
The phone won't
run away from you.

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:39.490
No, the phone
won't run away.

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:42.230
The phone won't.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:53.170
If you wanna see the
manager, you can just knock.

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:55.500
I don't have
any reason to.

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:58.310
Then make up a reason.

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.470
Watch the way Coach
Mitaka does it, and learn.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.150
Sorry, I don't have
that kind of polish.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:07.950
You just don't
have that kind of guts.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.290
You're pathetic!

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:25.220
So I don't
have any guts?

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.170
She's just mouthing off.

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.120
I'll show her my guts!

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:42.900
I'M...

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:44.340
...GOlNG...

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:49.380
...NOW!!

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:01.660
COME BACK...

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:04.480
...SOON!!

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:33.220
Only her voice
today, too.

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:06.380
Exactly 2000.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.210
Life will be hell
from tomorrow on.

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:12.120
I'll make do.

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:18.630
At least I've got a reason
to knock on her door, now.

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:24.550
Is this for me?

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:26.140
Yes.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:28.320
Shall I open it?

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:30.700
Be my guest.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.150
What beautiful earrings.

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:43.170
I'm so happy.

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:45.720
Kyoko!

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:51.840
--He's at it again!
--What is he doing?

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:53.280
--He's so weird.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.940
I've got to cure
this daydreaming habit.

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.540
Godai!
Up here! Up here!

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:06.980
Sorry I'm late.

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:11.960
Where'd you get the bump?
You're bleeding.

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.170
Here.
My hankie.

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:15.550
I-It's okay.

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.370
I've got one
of my own.

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:27.210
Welcome.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:28.970
C-Could I
have a coffee?

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:29.560
Okay.

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:34.890
So, Kozue
what's up?

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:37.270
Well, it's a
day early, but--

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:38.010
Here!

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.300
Merry Christmas!

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:47.630
T-Thank you.
W-What could it be?

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:52.040
A hat?

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:56.870
I knitted it. I didn't
do a very good job, though...

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.110
Try it on.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.010
Okay.

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:05.950
How cute!
You look great!

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:09.540
Oh, no! I forgot
to budget for Kozue!!

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:14.320
But she
gave me one--

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:18.990
I have to--

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.960
I have no choice.

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:51.620
Merry Christmas.

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:53.890
Wow, for me!?

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:58.090
Can I open it?

00:10:58.570 --> 00:10:59.560
B-Be my guest.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:03.870
Earrings!!

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:09.390
They make me
seem grown up.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:13.060
T-Think so?
They look good on you.

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:16.660
Thank you!
I'm so happy!!

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:19.870
I-I'm happy to
s-see you happy.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:46.390
Damn, I am an idiot!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.520
Am I gonna be wishy-washy
till the day I die?

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.410
The hat's so warm.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.820
Thank you!
I'm so happy!!

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:14.110
Kozue is a sweet kid.

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:16.550
She seemed so happy.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:20.310
I'm glad I did it.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.280
I did the right thing.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.410
I'M HOME!

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.200
WELCOME BACK!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.170
Just her voice again.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:43.940
This is getting old.

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:49.960
Godai?

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.600
M-Manager!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.690
It's been a while.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.500
I-I'll say!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:04.020
W-W-What've you
been doing for three days?

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:05.970
Here.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.190
It's a scarf
I knitted for you.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.620
Y-You mean-- for me?

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.770
I hope you like it.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.930
O-O-Of course I do!

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:27.190
I'm so glad. Please excuse me.
I'm going to get some rest.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.390
I've been at
it all night.

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:32.280
You've been
knitting all night?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.210
Yes.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:39.980
So, if you'll
excuse me...

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:41.870
T-Thank you!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:42.770
Sure.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:49.390
Thank you!

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:51.680
O-Oh, Manager!

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:53.250
Thank you!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:00.230
I'm so happy!
Manager, I'm so happy.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.320
A present.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:11.550
I don't have a present
for the manager!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.000
I could use
the rent money--

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.750
No, that's no good!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:32.060
A late rent will just mean
more problems for the manager.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:36.120
So it's the
food money.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:42.980
I doubt I'd die without
eating for four or five days.

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.490
What am I
gonna do?

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.540
I don't suppose
I could ask for it back--

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.100
Thank you!
I'm so happy!!

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:07.080
Thank you!
I'm so happy!!

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:20.520
Manager...

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:32.380
So the manager
knitted a scarf.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.170
Plus, she worked on
it for three days straight.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:40.510
Nice yarn, too.
Godai, it's warm!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.320
A moment.
Allow me.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.810
W-W-What're you doing!?

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.740
Don't stretch it out!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.560
This is my
best scarf!

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.340
What's with
your attitude?

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.390
Godai, come and join
us in refreshments.

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:03.990
It's too early
for spring cleaning!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:09.110
Hey! I asked you
not to stretch it!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:13.220
I've got something
I need to find.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:15.900
Just leave
me alone!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:21.060
That's weird. I thought
I left it in this drawer.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:23.500
What is it?

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:23.530
Whatever can it
be, Young Godai?
What is it?

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:24.960
Whatever can it
be, Young Godai?

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.810
I found my
entrance exam ID.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:32.060
Lemme see.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:34.830
The good old days.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:35.790
Show me.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:38.610
So it's been a year?

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:41.860
The life of a
ronin was hell.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:45.330
Your agonies are
apparent in the picture.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.700
Those pouting,
haunted eyes--

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:54.760
Anybody'd be haunted. Being
made a fool of all the time.

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:57.800
We make a fool
of you now.

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:00.930
Your position
is unchanged.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.980
Maison Ikkoku's
plaything.

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.030
Now, listen--

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.530
Anyway, congratulations
on finding what you wanted.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:10.380
Now to the bottle.

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:14.360
No! That's not
what I was looking for!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.370
I bid you good night.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:28.040
Akemi, go back to
your own room.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:29.340
Too much trouble.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.510
I'll have my
way with you!

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.790
I dare you
to try it.

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:41.720
She's not
even worried.

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:50.610
I found a 100 coin!

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:54.370
Idiot! What
can 100 buy?

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:58.890
Oh, geez!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.250
Have some
modesty!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:39.670
It's not here.

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:41.790
I give up.

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:58.610
Found it!!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.850
Is this for me?

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.360
Sorry it's
not wrapped--

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.260
Not at all.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.110
What a pretty brooch.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.580
Then you like it...?

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:19.960
Thank you very much.

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:20.980
You're welcome.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:25.120
Your eyes
are a little red.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:30.870
I was up all night.
I'll sleep in till evening.

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.230
I slept great.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:44.320
Sorry to keep you.

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.570
This scarf is
really warm.

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:01.070
I'm glad. And it
goes well with your hat.

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:08.090
And that looks
really nice on you.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:13.480
You think so? I wonder if I can
still wear ''cute'' accessories.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.240
Don't say that.
You're still young.

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:19.210
Maybe. I am
only 22 years old.

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:22.830
Twenty-two?

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:26.410
Two years older.
Just two years.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.190
That wouldn't keep us
from getting married.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.100
Just two years.

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.060
Coach Mitaka!

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:41.560
Hello. Godai, are you joining
the party at Chachamaru?

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:43.040
Yeah.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.540
Perfect. Let's
go together.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:48.220
Okay.

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:56.430
You seem to get cold
easily for one so young.

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.730
It's just that this
scarf is so warm.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.210
The manager knitted
her heart out for me.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:07.420
Ms. Otonashi
knitted it by hand?

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:12.130
Well, what can l say?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.550
Gotcha! You don't
have an answer to that!

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:19.180
It is getting
a bit chilly.

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:33.540
He's right! Ms. Otonashi,
your scarves are very warm!

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.070
R-Really?

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:44.800
I'm sorry to give you both the
same scarf. I'm not very skilled--

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:46.550
Not at all!

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.180
You can't top the contrasting
colors on the pattern.

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:52.190
--If you think you're special...
--If you think you're special...

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:53.520
--...you're sadly mistaken.
--...you're sadly mistaken.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.200
But what does she mean by
giving us the same scarf?

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:00.880
She can't be after
both of us at once.

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:04.890
Is she putting me on
the same level as Godai?

00:22:05.840 --> 00:22:07.150
What does she
have against me?

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:17.050
It's the manager!

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:21.800
Thanks for the scarf!
It's really warm!

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:23.360
Really?
That's great.

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:32.190
Manager,
thank you!

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:36.230
A warm scarf from a warm heart.
You're better than Saint Nick.

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:39.230
This shawl is
just so toasty.

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:45.540
It's for Christmas, and a thank
you for when I had my sprain.

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:51.470
She even knitted
one for my dad!

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:56.620
The whole family
should match--

00:22:57.230 --> 00:22:59.980
The old man was crying,
he was so happy.

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:18.430
We match. Like we're
made for each other.

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:20.870
I-I guess you're
right, Akemi.

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:24.710
I'm sorry it's just one pattern.
I didn't have enough time--

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:30.310
The same pattern, but the
contrasting colors are perfect.

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:33.310
Kyoko!
Knit one for me too!

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:35.130
O-Okay--

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:37.230
Whaddya gonna do?

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:51.720
Maison Ikkoku at night.

00:23:52.210 --> 00:23:55.200
A woman and a man
alone in the silence.

00:23:56.220 --> 00:23:59.260
Somewhere a temple bell
rings: Gong-gong.

00:24:00.220 --> 00:24:03.440
Next:
''Godai and Kyoko! An Evening for
Two Means Double the Trouble.''

00:24:04.230 --> 00:24:06.480
What'll I do?
I hope nothing happens--
